  triage:title "herdr_agent field added to HerdrMemberPresence is absent from both OpenAPI documents (docs/atm-http-runtime/openapi.yaml and crates/atm/openapi.yaml)" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr qa-pr1310-r7 (PR #1310, AY.15 herdr-name-uniqueness, FINAL head 10bc123f8; report: PR #1310 issuecomment 5575994618). schema-reviewer DOC-DRIFT. grep -c herdr_agent returns 0 for docs/atm-http-runtime/openapi.yaml and crates/atm/openapi.yaml although crates/atm-core/src/doctor/herdr_state.rs:218 serialises the new field on the doctor wire payload under the 1.2.0 bump. Required correction: add herdr_agent (with the Option/default shape chosen for AY15-QA-002) to both OpenAPI schemas." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ay" ;
